Body:
{{nodes.read_email.result.body}}

Here is the current leads sheet data (columns A-F: Company, Contact, Email, Stage, Next step, Last touch):
{{nodes.read_leads_sheet.result}}

Based on this email, identify which lead this is about (match by company, contact name, or email). Then propose updated values for:
- Stage (e.g., Initial Contact, Proposal, Negotiation, Closed Won, Closed Lost)
- Next step (e.g., Schedule call, Send proposal, Wait for decision)
- Last touch (today's date in YYYY-MM-DD format)

